                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Addictive, intense and hypnotizing !\nThat's how i can describe Devader in three words. 😄\n\nRight after getting the game i ended up playing it 15 hours in four days, so for someone like me who's pretty stacked with way too many games to play it's a good sign !\nIt's such an awesome game, quite hard and challenging but so rewarding once you complete a tough level.\n\nThe artstyle and graphics are beautiful with gorgeous 2D sprites mixed with 3D elements.\nDevader is probably one of the the most visually intense game i ever played, it's ecstatic.\nThe music also fit the gameplay really well, when playing it's like entering another trippy dimension lol.\n\nGameplay wise it's simple but hard to master, it's fast paced and there's depth into it.\nControls are responsive and precise, performances are rock solid with smooth unlocked framerate.\nIt's really challenging, it does takes skills, non stop action with a bit of strategy !\n\nYou can chose different perks and skills for your devader, it's really satisfying to see it evolve into an unstoppable killing machine. 😈\nThe game offer great replay value, depending on your performance the levels are subject to change.\n\nOverall it's an absolute blast to play, i had way more fun playing this game comparing to another similar title (chippie).\nDevader is more fun, more forgiving and more respectful to your time IMO.\nI absolutely recommended the game to any twin stick shooter players and also bullet hell fans.\n\nReally a great indie game, congratulations to marcgfx for making such an amazing game.\nSAVE THE MATRIX !\n\n[h1]Rating 7.5/10[/h1]\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/38118731/]Click here to follow my curator if this review was useful to you.[/url]",
